---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About · Christoph Rönnecke" path="/about/" description="Tonmeister based in Leipzig — UdK Berlin, MDR Klassik, radio3 and Emil Berliner Studios.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>
        I am a Tonmeister (M.Mus., Universität der Künste Berlin) based in Leipzig.
        My work focuses on recording, musical production and finishing for acoustic music —
        chamber ensembles, song and orchestral broadcast alike.
      </p>
      <p>
        Since 2021 I work regularly for MDR Klassik / MDR Kultur on concert captures and
        post-production. Since 2022 I also contribute to music production at radio3, the
        culture channel of rbb. Earlier I was Tonmeister at Emil Berliner Studios in Berlin,
        responsible for smaller client productions and studio IT.
      </p>
      <p>
        I read the score while I work. Ensembles hire me when they want broadcast discipline
        without an institutional machine — and a calm session that still aims at a release.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Start a conversation</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/work/">See selected work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
